{{also|Wehren}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|weren}}, from {{inh|de|goh|werien}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*warjan}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*warjaną}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|[veːɐ̯n]|[ˈveːʁən]}}
* {{audio|de|De-wehren.ogg}}
* {{rhymes|de|eːʀən|s=2}}
* {{hyphenation|de|weh|ren}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb}}

# {{lb|de|reflexive}} to [[defend]]
#: {{uxi|de|Ich wollte mich doch nur wehren.|I only tried to defend myself.}}
# (with dative, somewhat archaic) to prevent the spread of something, [[fight]] something
# (archaic) to hinder

